{"id":"732c8884db2d0c67","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md","title":"Bounded Quantifier Formulas $\\Delta 0^0$","display":"df-delta-0-formula — Bounded Quantifier Formulas $\\Delta_0^0$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-delta-0-formula","aliases":["58-df-delta-0-formula"],"display":"df-delta-0-formula — Bounded Quantifier Formulas $\\Delta_0^0$","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-term.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-subformula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-delta-0-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-delta-0-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-delta-0-formula — Bounded Quantifier Formulas <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0\">\\(\\Delta_0^0\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca5c1762b574813b\" href=\"?note=ca5c1762b574813b\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md\">../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-term.md\">../batch05/58-df-term.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"621985f38a386342\" href=\"?note=621985f38a386342\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-subformula.md\">../batch01/58-df-subformula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{rel}}:\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\to\\omega\">\\(a_{\\mathrm{rel}}:\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\to\\omega\\)</span> (its relation-symbol component and relation-arity map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (一阶公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (原子公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ca5c1762b574813b\" href=\"?note=ca5c1762b574813b\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md\">../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (项集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-term.md\">../batch05/58-df-term.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\">\\(b\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(b)=2\">\\(a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(b)=2\\)</span> (designated binary bounding relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{0,b}^0(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\Delta_{0,b}^0(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (bounded-quantifier formula class relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta\\text{-}0\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\Delta_{0,b}^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\,(b(x,t)\\to\\varphi)\\bigr)\\in D\\land\n\\bigl(\\exists x\\,(b(x,t)\\land\\varphi)\\bigr)\\in D\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\},\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta\\text{-}0\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\Delta_{0,b}^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\,(b(x,t)\\to\\varphi)\\bigr)\\in D\\land\n\\bigl(\\exists x\\,(b(x,t)\\land\\varphi)\\bigr)\\in D\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\},\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta\\text{-}0\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}notation}\\vdash &lt;\\,\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\land a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(&lt;)=2\\to\\Delta_0^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\Delta_{0,&lt;}^0(\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta\\text{-}0\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}notation}\\vdash &lt;\\,\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\land a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(&lt;)=2\\to\\Delta_0^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\Delta_{0,&lt;}^0(\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0\">\\(\\Delta_0^0\\)</span> 公式也称为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0^0 = \\Pi_0^0\">\\(\\Sigma_0^0 = \\Pi_0^0\\)</span>，即只有有界量词的公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的所有子公式集合（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"621985f38a386342\" href=\"?note=621985f38a386342\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-subformula.md\">../batch01/58-df-subformula.md</a>）；有界量词形如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x &lt; \\check{y}\">\\(\\forall x &lt; \\check{y}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x &lt; \\check{y}\">\\(\\exists x &lt; \\check{y}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y \\in \\omega\">\\(y \\in \\omega\\)</span> 是自然数项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\check{y}\">\\(\\check{y}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的自由变元集（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>）。</li>\n<li>有界量词不是任意签名自动具有的构造：它依赖签名中指定的二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>；算术记号取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b={&lt;}\">\\(b={&lt;}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;_b t\\;\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x&lt;_b t\\;\\varphi\\)</span> 展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,(b(x,t)\\to\\varphi)\">\\(\\forall x\\,(b(x,t)\\to\\varphi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x&lt;_b t\\;\\varphi\">\\(\\exists x&lt;_b t\\;\\varphi\\)</span> 展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\,(b(x,t)\\land\\varphi)\">\\(\\exists x\\,(b(x,t)\\land\\varphi)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>在算术层级中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0\">\\(\\Delta_0^0\\)</span> 是基础层级，其他层级由前缀交替构造</li>\n<li>自然数项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\check{y}\">\\(\\check{y}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 的 numeral，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(S(\\cdots S(0)\\cdots))\">\\(S(S(\\cdots S(0)\\cdots))\\)</span> 共 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 个后继函数</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> — 一阶公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"621985f38a386342\" href=\"?note=621985f38a386342\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-subformula.md\">../batch01/58-df-subformula.md</a> — 子公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a> — 自由变元</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"1d779f4a08a1f22e\" href=\"?note=1d779f4a08a1f22e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md\">../batch17/58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md</a> — 算术层级</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca5c1762b574813b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-term.md","status":"resolved","id":"db7ec154138d5972","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-term.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-subformula.md","status":"resolved","id":"621985f38a386342","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-subformula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma\\in V$ (signature, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (一阶公式集, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca5c1762b574813b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (原子公式集, see [[../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-term.md","status":"resolved","id":"db7ec154138d5972","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ (项集, see [[../batch05/58-df-term.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-subformula.md","status":"resolved","id":"621985f38a386342","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)$ 是 $\\varphi$ 的所有子公式集合（见 [[../batch01/58-df-subformula.md]]）；有界量词形如 $\\forall x < \\check{y}$ 或 $\\exists x < \\check{y}$，其中 $y \\in \\omega$ 是自然数项 $\\check{y}$。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)$ 是 $\\varphi$ 的自由变元集（见 [[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]] — 一阶公式","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-subformula.md","status":"resolved","id":"621985f38a386342","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-subformula.md]] — 子公式","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","